# Semantic comments

When adding or editing comments in Kotlin sources, follow `.github/instructions/semantic-comments.instructions.md`.

- Document observable behavior, constraints, and non-obvious rationale.
- KDoc on public API; user-visible text via `message()` + `ArmeriaBundle.properties`.
- For complex collectors/PSI logic, outline the spec in comments before implementing.
